# Traditional Chinese terms written by the release coordinator for 18.0.2.0.0: audit events, help texts,
# field labels of the folder mailbox, the request mail template, and release 18.0.1 messages that the
# earlier catalog had missed. Read first by ops tooling (00- prefix): it wins over the lane fragments.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: zh_TW\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "A folder under legal hold cannot be deleted."
msgstr "受法律保留的資料夾不能刪除。"

msgid "Fields that only the server sets"
msgstr "只能由伺服器設定的欄位"

msgid "Move a document to the trash before deleting it permanently."
msgstr "請先把文件移到回收桶，才能永久刪除。"

msgid "Move a folder to the trash before deleting it permanently."
msgstr "請先把資料夾移到回收桶，才能永久刪除。"

msgid "Use the document trash actions to change folder state."
msgstr "請使用回收桶的動作變更資料夾狀態。"

msgid ""
"The name of the record that the file is attached to, when you may read it."
msgstr "檔案所附加的紀錄名稱（您有權讀取該紀錄時才會顯示）。"

msgid "Locked"
msgstr "已鎖定"

msgid "Unlocked"
msgstr "已解除鎖定"

msgid "Duplicated"
msgstr "已建立副本"

msgid "Version added"
msgstr "已新增版本"

msgid "Version restored"
msgstr "已還原版本"

msgid "Version deleted"
msgstr "已刪除版本"

msgid "File requested"
msgstr "已索取檔案"

msgid "Request fulfilled"
msgstr "已完成索取"

msgid "Access expired"
msgstr "存取權已到期"

msgid "Filed automatically"
msgstr "已自動歸檔"

msgid "Received by email"
msgstr "已由電子郵件收到"

msgid "PDF split"
msgstr "已分割 PDF"

msgid "PDF merged"
msgstr "已合併 PDF"

msgid "1-3, 4, 5-8"
msgstr "1-3, 4, 5-8"

msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"          <p>A file is requested from you: <strong><t t-out=\"object.name\"/></strong></p>\n"
"          <p t-if=\"object.request_deadline\">Due date: <t t-out=\"format_date(object.request_deadline)\"/></p>\n"
"          <p t-if=\"object.request_note\"><t t-out=\"object.request_note\"/></p>\n"
"          <p>Sign in to send the file:</p>\n"
"          <p><a t-att-href=\"ctx.get('woow_notice_url')\"><t t-out=\"ctx.get('woow_notice_url')\"/></a></p>\n"
"        </div>\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"          <p>有人向您索取檔案：<strong><t t-out=\"object.name\"/></strong></p>\n"
"          <p t-if=\"object.request_deadline\">期限：<t t-out=\"format_date(object.request_deadline)\"/></p>\n"
"          <p t-if=\"object.request_note\"><t t-out=\"object.request_note\"/></p>\n"
"          <p>請登入後上傳檔案：</p>\n"
"          <p><a t-att-href=\"ctx.get('woow_notice_url')\"><t t-out=\"ctx.get('woow_notice_url')\"/></a></p>\n"
"        </div>\n"
"      "

msgid "<span class=\"px-1\">@</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"px-1\">@</span>"

msgid ""
"A Python dictionary that will be evaluated to provide default values when "
"creating new records for this alias."
msgstr "一個 Python 字典，用這個收信地址建立新紀錄時，會計算它來提供預設值。"

msgid "Alias"
msgstr "收信地址"

msgid "Alias Contact Security"
msgstr "收信地址的寄件人限制"

msgid "Alias Domain"
msgstr "收信網域"

msgid "Alias Domain Name"
msgstr "收信網域名稱"

msgid "Alias Email"
msgstr "收信電子郵件地址"

msgid "Alias Name"
msgstr "收信地址名稱"

msgid "Alias Status"
msgstr "收信地址狀態"

msgid "Alias status assessed on the last message received."
msgstr "依最後一封收到的郵件判斷的收信地址狀態。"

msgid "Aliased Model"
msgstr "收信對應的模型"

msgid "Custom Bounced Message"
msgstr "自訂退信訊息"

msgid "Default Values"
msgstr "預設值"

msgid "Email domain e.g. 'example.com' in 'odoo@example.com'"
msgstr "電子郵件網域，例如 'odoo@example.com' 中的 'example.com'"

msgid ""
"Everyone who can open the target folder will see the filed files, even if they cannot\n"
"            open the record that a file came from."
msgstr ""
"凡是能開啟目標資料夾的人，都會看到歸檔的檔案，\n"
"            即使他們無法開啟檔案原本所在的紀錄。"

msgid "Favorite"
msgstr "我的最愛"

msgid ""
"ID of the parent record holding the alias (example: project holding the task"
" creation alias)"
msgstr "持有這個收信地址的上層紀錄 ID（例如：持有「建立任務」收信地址的專案）"

msgid ""
"If set, this content will automatically be sent out to unauthorized users "
"instead of the default message."
msgstr "設定後，會改用這段內容自動回覆未獲授權的寄件人，取代預設訊息。"

msgid "Local-part based incoming detection"
msgstr "依地址本地部分判斷來信"

msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

msgid "Model of the kind of record"
msgstr "紀錄類型的模型"

msgid ""
"Only the followers of this mailbox can send files to it. Add the colleagues who may send\n"
"            as followers below. A file is stored only if its sender has at least upload access to the\n"
"            folder when the mail arrives; the mail text is not kept."
msgstr ""
"只有這個信箱的追蹤者可以寄檔案進來。請把可以寄送的同事\n"
"            加為下方的追蹤者。郵件到達時，寄件人必須至少有該資料夾的上傳權限，\n"
"            檔案才會存入；郵件內文不會保存。"

msgid ""
"Optional ID of a thread (record) to which all incoming messages will be "
"attached, even if they did not reply to it. If set, this will disable the "
"creation of new records completely."
msgstr "選填。所有來信都會附加到這個討論串（紀錄）的 ID，即使來信不是回覆它。設定後就完全不會建立新紀錄。"

msgid "Parent Model"
msgstr "上層模型"

msgid "Parent Record Thread ID"
msgstr "上層紀錄討論串 ID"

msgid ""
"Parent model holding the alias. The model holding the alias reference is not"
" necessarily the model given by alias_model_id (example: project "
"(parent_model) and task (model))"
msgstr ""
"持有這個收信地址的上層模型。持有收信地址參照的模型，不一定是 alias_model_id "
"指定的模型（例如：專案（parent_model）與任務（model））"

msgid ""
"Policy to post a message on the document using the mailgateway.\n"
"- everyone: everyone can post\n"
"- partners: only authenticated partners\n"
"- followers: only followers of the related document or members of following channels\n"
msgstr ""
"透過郵件閘道在紀錄上張貼訊息的規則：\n"
"- everyone：任何人都可以張貼\n"
"- partners：只有通過驗證的聯絡人\n"
"- followers：只有相關紀錄的追蹤者，或追蹤中頻道的成員\n"

msgid "Record Thread ID"
msgstr "紀錄討論串 ID"

msgid ""
"The model (Odoo Document Kind) to which this alias corresponds. Any incoming"
" email that does not reply to an existing record will cause the creation of "
"a new record of this model (e.g. a Project Task)"
msgstr "這個收信地址對應的模型（Odoo 文件類型）。凡是不是回覆既有紀錄的來信，都會建立一筆這個模型的新紀錄（例如專案任務）"

msgid ""
"The name of the email alias, e.g. 'jobs' if you want to catch emails for "
"<jobs@example.odoo.com>"
msgstr "收信地址的名稱，例如要接收寄給 <jobs@example.odoo.com> 的郵件時填 'jobs'"

msgid ""
"This looks at the next batch of attachments of the kind of record named by the rule that\n"
"          are not filed yet, and files them in the target folder. You can run it again until\n"
"          nothing is left to look at. A file whose record is of another company, is gone, or cannot be\n"
"          read by you is left out, and so is a file that was imported by hand before. A document that\n"
"          was deleted for good is filed again by a later pass."
msgstr ""
"這會檢查規則所指紀錄類型中，下一批尚未歸檔的附件，\n"
"          並把它們歸檔到目標資料夾。可以重複執行，直到沒有剩下可檢查的附件。\n"
"          紀錄屬於其他公司、已不存在或您無法讀取的檔案會被略過，\n"
"          之前手動匯入過的檔案也會略過。被永久刪除的文件，之後的執行會再次歸檔。"

msgid "Wizard"
msgstr "精靈"

msgid "Woow Locked By Other"
msgstr "由他人鎖定"

msgid "merged.pdf"
msgstr "merged.pdf"

msgid "Wizard rows that name records of the module"
msgstr "指向本模組紀錄的精靈資料列"
